      title: 'Medicaid Increases Emergency-Department Use: Evidence from Oregon''s Health Insurance Experiment'
      authors: Taubman, Allen, Wright, Baicker and Finkelstein, Science
      year: 2014
      finding: Coverage raised ED visits by 0.41 per person (SE 0.12) over about 18 months, about 40% on a control mean of 1.02; first stage 24.7 points; 24,646 people in the Portland area.
