      expr: 144800/d
sources:
    - id: fhl2019
      title: 'The Value of Medicaid: Interpreting Results from the Oregon Health Insurance Experiment'
      authors: Finkelstein, Hendren and Luttmer, Journal of Political Economy
      year: 2019
      finding: Gross Medicaid cost $3,600 per recipient-year; net cost $1,448; 60% is a transfer to providers of uncompensated care.
